<section class="certification" id="certification">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">品质检测与合规信息</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">严格品控，第三方检测认证，用得安心</p>
    <div class="cert-grid">
      <div class="cert-card">
        <div class="cert-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-certificate"></i></div>
        <h3>头皮清洁评价</h3>
        <p>经第三方检测机构验证，产品清洁力达标，温和不刺激。支持咨询查看完整检测报告。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cert-card">
        <div class="cert-icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-virus"></i></div>
        <h3>成分合规说明</h3>
        <p>所有成分符合《化妆品安全技术规范》要求，5大0添加配方，提供完整成分标签与合规文件。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cert-card">
        <div class="cert-icon"><i class="fas fa-microscope"></i></div>
        <h3>使用安全建议</h3>
        <p>适用各类肤质（含敏感头皮），建议首次使用前做局部测试。具体频次可咨询客服获取个性化建议。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.cert-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 28px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.cert-card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 36px 28px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  border: 1px solid #e8f0e0;
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}
.cert-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.cert-icon { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.cert-icon i { font-size: 40px; color: #4a7c3f; }
.cert-card h3 { font-size: 18px; color: #2d4a2a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.cert-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Certification",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Certification" }]
}
{% endschema %}